## 🔒 Security & Quality Gates (Per Your Standards)

All prompts MUST include:

### Input Validation
```
- Type checking (strings, numbers, enums only)
- Length limits (max 500 chars per field)
- Regex patterns for emails, URLs
- Sanitize user input before grounding
```

### Security Checklist
```
□ No secrets in prompts (API keys via env only)
□ SQL injection prevention (parameterized queries)
□ XSS protection (escape HTML/JavaScript)
□ OWASP Top 10 compliance documented
□ Row-level security (RLS) for Supabase queries
```

### Quality Gates (Before Production)
```
□ CoT reasoning validated
□ Schema output parseable (JSON valid)
□ Error messages non-sensitive (no stack traces)
□ Performance under 100ms for API calls
□ Security audit passed (manual review)
```

