## 🆘 Troubleshooting

### "My prompts aren't producing what I want"
→ **Solution:** Apply Self-Eval (Technique #6)
→ Add rubric: "Score your output on: accuracy (1-5), security (1-5), performance (1-5)"
→ Tell AI to critique itself and revise

### "Token costs are too high"
→ **Solution:** Use Modular Prompting (Technique #9)
→ Break complex task into 3-5 micro-prompts instead of one giant prompt
→ Result: Same output, 30-40% fewer tokens

### "I'm getting different results each time"
→ **Solution:** Add Few-Shot Learning (Technique #7)
→ Provide 3-5 examples of desired output format
→ Add temperature note: "Respond deterministically, not creatively"

### "How do I integrate with my Make.com workflow?"
→ **Solution:** Use Schema Prompting (Technique #10) + Modular Prompting (Technique #9)
→ Generate JSON matching your Make.com webhook schema
→ Test: Copy JSON output directly into Make.com action

